hi bob,
something I overlooked was that the config was in a sort of sh run formal mode.
apparently the tool doesn’t support this config mode and likes the tree/hierarchical better like this

system {
    host-name BLABLA;
    time-zone Asia/Calcutta

We need to document this somewhere, as it took almost half of engineering to confirm that this works (but we could not articulate the cookbook approach correctly).

